20) Counsel for the claimants has placed reliance on a judgment dt. 31.12.2019 in RFA no.360 of 2018, where the subject matter was land also covered by the same Notification as in the instant case,
and forming part of the same Award no.653 dt. 06.08.2012, and contended that a Division Bench of this Court in the said case had held that the market value of acquired land was Rs.7 lakhs per bigha irrespective of its classification and category alongwith interest and all statutory benefits as per law;
and the claimants also should be granted the same amount as compensation for their land of 46-14 bighas.
